WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,380
You gave it away

2
00:00:01,380 --> 00:00:03,380
It’s just that Yu Yu hasn’t met her grandparents yet.

3
00:00:03,380 --> 00:00:05,380
So I want to take her back to have a look

4
00:00:05,380 --> 00:00:07,450
Make your parents happy

5
00:00:07,450 --> 00:00:16,140
Go alone, go alone, brother

6
00:00:16,140 --> 00:00:19,330
No need. I'll go with you. No need.

7
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:20,330
I'll go by myself

8
00:00:20,330 --> 00:00:37,400
Do you have grandparents too?

9
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:39,400
Why have you never told Yu Yu?

10
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:41,530
Don't they like Yu Yu?

11
00:00:41,530 --> 00:00:42,530
Because grandpa and grandma
